{"description": "Pixel art TV home shopping broadcast frame, a 2000s CRT TV shot, 4:3, packed with detail, no empty wall. DEPTH: camera slightly above eye level, one-point perspective toward the middle; a raised stage whose floor lines run back to the set; the side set panels angle inward; layers from front to back: stage edge, podium and table, host, set panels, a screen set into the wall, the truss. LEFT: MEDIUM SHOT of the show host, head to hands, face about 60 pixels wide, behind a glossy red podium with a chrome edge, its top and right side visible, both hands resting on its top edge, facing the camera. Black suit, white shirt, dark red tie, combed black hair, unnaturally white made-up face, huge eyes completely black with no whites, thin closed-lip smile, no teeth. Above him a set arch lined with one row of evenly spaced round marquee bulbs. Far left edge: a tall live chat monitor with rows of grey lines, gift boxes and shipping boxes below it. TOP: a black light truss with six separate spotlights; the three on the right throw clear light beams. Between the arch and the right side: two stacked cue light boxes with clap and smile icons. RIGHT: a sales board of red digits; under it a large flat studio screen with a glowing order graphic of bars, framed all around by evenly spaced round marquee bulbs; below it a waist-high demo table with a white cloth, its top and left side visible, and on it a low round turntable display stand with a striped rim, its top bare and empty. STAGE: glossy black floor with reflections; between podium and table a red Korean street mailbox with an upside-down dried-blood cross; the front face of the raised stage holds one row of square glowing light tiles. Behind everything glossy red and black lacquer set panels with gold trim. LIGHT: key light on his face and the turntable, pink and cyan rim light, deep black shadows. Dense, highly detailed pixel art, crisp pixel clusters, no dithering, no blur. No letters, no words, no other people.", "image_size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "no_background": false, "reference_images": [{"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "usage_description": "LAYOUT, SIZE AND DEPTH: copy where things are, how big they are and the perspective from this line drawing: the vanishing point, the floor lines, the angled set sides, the stage front with its light tiles, the host from head to hands on the left, face this big, the bulb rows, the six spotlights, the cue lights, the chat monitor at the far left, the sales board and the bulb-framed screen on the right, the table with the round turntable, the mailbox. Do not copy the white or the lines."}, {"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 390, "height": 105}, "usage_description": "PIXEL SCALE: these product icons will be placed on the turntable at exactly this pixel size. Match their pixel density, outline thickness and shading. Do not draw these objects."}]}